    <unit id="=&gt;q13" name="=&gt;q13">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">26</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>I'm not really with these guys. I was doing my thing around here and the earthquake trapped me in here with them. Not really in mood for a talk, okay?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Я не з цими хлопцями. Я тут займався своїми справами, і землетрус загнав мене сюди з ними. Мені зараз не до розмов, добре?&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
